          "text": [
            "\u001b[1m3/3\u001b[0m \u001b[32m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[0m \u001b[1m0s\u001b[0m 116ms/step - accuracy: 0.9651 - loss: 0.1255\n",
            "Best validation accuracy: 0.9882352948188782\n",
