      "source": [
        "## C1 — Learning Rate Tuning\n",
        "\n",
        "Keep the architecture fixed.\n",
        "\n",
        "Test:\n",
        "\n",
        "```python\n",
        "1e-2\n",
        "1e-3\n",
        "1e-4\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "For every learning rate, **rebuild the model from fresh weights**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Compare:\n",
        "- Training speed\n",
        "- Stability\n",
        "- Validation performance"
      ]
