        "## C3 — Early Stopping\n",
        "\n",
        "Use:\n",
        "\n",
        "```python\n",
        "early_stop = keras.callbacks.EarlyStopping(\n",
        "    monitor=\"val_loss\",\n",
        "    patience=5,\n",
        "    restore_best_weights=True\n",
        ")\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Train with a high maximum such as `epochs=100`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Analyze:\n",
        "- When did training stop?\n",
        "- Was it before epoch 100?\n",
        "- Did it stop near the best validation point?"
      ]
    },
