      "source": [
        "## C6 — Optional L2 Regularization\n",
        "\n",
        "Example:\n",
        "\n",
        "```python\n",
        "from tensorflow.keras.regularizers import l2\n",
        "\n",
        "layers.Dense(\n",
        "    64,\n",
        "    activation=\"relu\",\n",
        "    kernel_regularizer=l2(0.001)\n",
        ")\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Test whether L2 reduces overfitting on your selected model."
      ]
